# Ducal Hospitality (jeuno 68): Ru'Lude Gardens' Taillegeas (no script; default 10061; Trust: Cherukiki's 10235 wants a
# trust permit: none here). A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 4 (150 in each nation: 450 / 2 = 225), CoP The Road
# Forks current (A Vessel Without a Captain completed; The Warrior's Path not: option 0 is 0 throughout), two of set 2's
# items and set 1's (a GM, before login). Available: 10057 with a drawn set (math.randomInt(1, 5): the trace shows it),
# option 10: not begun; 10057 again (a new draw), option 0: begun. A GM sets ItemSet 0: set 2 traded: nil (the trade's
# ItemSet > 0 check). A GM sets ItemSet 2 (the draw fixed): 10059 (set 2:
# items 1-3, [4] = [5] = 0, text 1); set 2 less one item: nil; set 2 and a Goblin Pie: nil; set 2 exactly: 10058 ([6] =
# 1), finished: completed (4000 gil, Ducal Dupe), fame +5 x3, the trade taken, the mustZone (the completed state's 10058
# finish runs in the same lookup and is skipped by that mustZone). Completed: ItemSet 0 (cleared by the completion),
# the mustZone: 10060; a trade of set 2: nil (ItemSet 0). Out to Upper Jeuno and back (the mustZone cleared): 10057 (a
# draw), option 10: ItemSet 0; 10057 (a draw), option 0: kept; a GM sets ItemSet 1: 10059 (set 1: five items, text 0);
# set 1 less one: nil; set 1 traded: 10058 ([6] = 0), finished: the trade taken, the mustZone, ItemSet 0, 4000 gil, fame +5 x3. A GM sets
# ItemSet 2 with the mustZone still set: 10059; set 2 traded: 10058, finished: the mustZone set: nothing (the items
# kept, no gil). The Lua error arm (ItemSet 0 while accepted) is not flowed: see the README.
lists RuludeGardens/Taillegeas/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Taillegeas/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10057 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10058 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10059 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10060
warning: quests: jeuno.ducal_hospitality: one finish of 10058 ran 2 handlers (2/-/onEventFinish:10058, 3/-/onEventFinish:10058) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at Ducal_Hospitality.lua:162 (accepted) and :243 (completed) at lua-at 3f5cf4f2 hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=29.5,2,58 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 150
fame Bastok 150
fame Windurst 150
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
item PileOfChocoboBedding x2
item SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x2
item MyFirstMagicKit x2
item HandfulOfCounterfeitGil
item LoafOfGoblinBread
item GoblinDoll
item GoblinMushpot
item GoblinPie
login
trigger Taillegeas                      # available: 10057, a drawn set
finish option=10                        # not begun
trigger Taillegeas                      # 10057, a new draw
finish option=0                         # begun
charvar Quest[3][68]ItemSet 0           # a GM: no set while accepted
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 MyFirstMagicKit x1 # ItemSet 0: nil (the trade's > 0 check)
charvar Quest[3][68]ItemSet 2           # a GM: set 2
trigger Taillegeas                      # accepted: 10059 (set 2, [4] 0, [5] 0, [6] 1)
finish
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 # set 2 less one: nil; nothing
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 MyFirstMagicKit x1 GoblinPie x1 # set 2 and an extra item: nil
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 MyFirstMagicKit x1 # set 2 exactly: 10058 ([0] 0, [6] 1)
finish                                  # completed: 4000 gil, Ducal Dupe; fame +5 x3; the trade taken; the mustZone
trigger Taillegeas                      # completed, ItemSet 0, the mustZone: 10060
finish
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 MyFirstMagicKit x1 # ItemSet 0: nil; nothing
warp -55.5,8.2,97.5 UpperJeuno          # another zone: the mustZone cleared
warp 29.5,2,58 RuludeGardens
trigger Taillegeas                      # no ItemSet, no mustZone: 10057, a draw
finish option=10                        # ItemSet 0
trigger Taillegeas                      # 10057, a draw
finish option=0                         # the drawn set kept
charvar Quest[3][68]ItemSet 1           # a GM: set 1
trigger Taillegeas                      # ItemSet 1: 10059 (set 1, five items, [6] 0)
finish
trade Taillegeas HandfulOfCounterfeitGil x1 LoafOfGoblinBread x1 GoblinDoll x1 GoblinMushpot x1 # set 1 less one: nil
trade Taillegeas HandfulOfCounterfeitGil x1 LoafOfGoblinBread x1 GoblinDoll x1 GoblinMushpot x1 GoblinPie x1 # 10058 ([6] 0)
finish                                  # the trade taken, the mustZone, ItemSet 0, 4000 gil, fame +5 x3
charvar Quest[3][68]ItemSet 2           # a GM, the mustZone still set
trigger Taillegeas                      # ItemSet 2 (before the mustZone): 10059
finish
trade Taillegeas PileOfChocoboBedding x1 SetOfKaiserinCosmetics x1 MyFirstMagicKit x1 # 10058
finish                                  # the mustZone set: nothing (the items kept, no gil)
